+| Classification | Count |
+|---|---:|
+| `DEFINITION` | 25 |
+| `OPERATIONAL_RULE` | 0 |
+| `PROVED_DERIVED_LEMMA` | 0 |
+| `DOMAIN_LEMMA` | 2 |
+| Total | 27 |
