+  two opaque min/max aliases;
+- `DOMAIN_LEMMA`: the cast `#Ceil` characterization and dynamic subtraction
+  equation.
+
+No simplification rule is classified as `OPERATIONAL_RULE` or
+`PROVED_DERIVED_LEMMA`.
